  "title": "GREEN SM LAUNCHES GREEN SM LIMO, A FULLY ELECTRIC TAXI SERVICE IN INDIA",
  "summary": "New Delhi, India, June 5, 2026 - Green SM officially launched Green SM Limo in New Delhi today, marking the company’s entry into India, one of the world’s largest and most dynamic mobility markets. With this milestone, India becomes Green SM’s fifth international market, following Vietnam, Laos, Indonesia, and the Philippines.",
